Description: HSM-like software isolation for cryptographic keys
 Reliquary is a setgid daemon that provides hardware-security-module-like
 isolation for private keys in software. Keys live in a group-owned store
 that only the setgid daemon can read; clients talk to it over a per-user
 socket and never touch key material directly.
 .
 This package ships the daemon (reliquaryd), the administration tool
 (reliquary-tool), a scdaemon-compatible proxy for GnuPG, a PKCS#11
 provider module, and systemd user units for on-demand activation.
